values
  ('WW-001', 'Atom Automatic Cover', 'Cover', 'Wonderlands World', 'Custom', NULL, 2500000, 'https://www.wonderlandsworld.com/media/91acd1a8-9997-4d59-8c6d-a8635810989b.webp', 'There is a particular calm to a pool that closes itself. The Atom automatic cover draws across the water at the touch of a button, forming a composed safety barrier that keeps debris out and holds heat and chemistry in, custom-fit to your pool''s exact geometry. Its drive system and components are professional-grade Pentair and Vevor equipment, built to a commercial standard. The price includes delivery and professional installation by Wonderlands World in Central Florida. Book a free design consult at wonderlandsworld.com and let''s design yours.', 'https://www.wonderlandsworld.com/flip', 'live', 1),
  ('WW-002', 'Eclipse Automatic Cover', 'Cover', 'Wonderlands World', 'Custom', NULL, 2700000, 'https://www.wonderlandsworld.com/media/1fd97401-223a-4a79-bf65-e7734138513e.webp', 'The Eclipse treats safety as a design element. One touch sends the cover gliding across the pool, where it rests as a clean, load-bearing surface — warmer water beneath, less skimming above, and a stillness that suits a considered backyard. Every motor, control, and fitting is professional-grade Pentair and Vevor equipment, selected for quiet, dependable operation. The price includes delivery and professional installation by Wonderlands World in Central Florida. Book a free design consult at wonderlandsworld.com and let''s design yours.', 'https://www.wonderlandsworld.com/flip', 'live', 2),
  ('WW-003', 'CS3000 Automatic Cover', 'Cover', 'Wonderlands World', 'Custom', NULL, 3000000, 'https://www.wonderlandsworld.com/media/5d870105-61a5-4d79-a200-33c70c5ac38f.webp', 'Premium coverage, expressed quietly. The CS3000 automatic cover seals the pool against debris and evaporation while presenting a tailored, architectural line at rest — safety and efficiency without visual noise. Its mechanism is assembled from professional-grade Pentair and Vevor components and hardware, engineered for daily use over many seasons. The price includes delivery and professional installation by Wonderlands World in Central Florida. Book a free design consult at wonderlandsworld.com and let''s design yours.', 'https://www.wonderlandsworld.com/flip', 'live', 3),
  ('WW-004', 'Infinity 4000 Cover', 'Cover', 'Wonderlands World', 'Custom', NULL, 3200000, 'https://www.wonderlandsworld.com/media/695627f9-9391-4b1c-babd-a352309fd232.webp', 'Our most accomplished cover, finished to disappear. The Infinity 4000 spans the pool with a sleek, near-seamless surface that delivers the highest measure of safety and thermal efficiency in the collection, then retreats from view entirely. The drive and control systems are professional-grade Pentair and Vevor equipment throughout, specified without compromise. The price includes delivery and professional installation by Wonderlands World in Central Florida. Book a free design consult at wonderlandsworld.com and let''s design yours.', 'https://www.wonderlandsworld.com/flip', 'live', 4),
  ('WW-005', 'Prague Driveway Gate 14''×6''', 'Gate', 'Wonderlands World', '14'' × 6''', NULL, 678500, 'https://www.wonderlandsworld.com/media/prague-driveway-gate.webp', 'An entrance sets the terms for everything beyond it. The Prague gate carries classic European ironwork across a 14'' × 6'' span — measured, symmetrical, and quietly grand, giving the front of the home privacy and presence in equal measure. Its hinges, operators, and hardware are professional-grade Pentair and Vevor components, built to a commercial standard. The price includes delivery and professional installation by Wonderlands World in Central Florida. Book a free design consult at wonderlandsworld.com and let''s design yours.', 'https://www.wonderlandsworld.com/flip', 'live', 5),
  ('WW-006', 'Prague Driveway Gate 12''×6''', 'Gate', 'Wonderlands World', '12'' × 6''', NULL, 782000, 'https://www.wonderlandsworld.com/media/prague-driveway-gate.webp', 'Old-world proportion, tailored to a 12'' × 6'' opening. The Prague gate brings the detailing of European estate ironwork to the modern Central Florida home — a composed arrival that reads as architecture rather than accessory. Every hinge, motor, and fitting is a professional-grade Pentair and Vevor component, chosen for smooth, lasting operation. The price includes delivery and professional installation by Wonderlands World in Central Florida. Book a free design consult at wonderlandsworld.com and let''s design yours.', 'https://www.wonderlandsworld.com/flip', 'flagged', 6),
  ('WW-007', 'Prague Driveway Gate 16''×6''', 'Gate', 'Wonderlands World', '16'' × 6''', NULL, 805000, 'https://www.wonderlandsworld.com/media/prague-driveway-gate.webp', 'Width, handled with restraint. Across a 16'' × 6'' span, the Prague gate holds its European lines without sag or visual weight, framing larger driveways with the calm of a well-drawn elevation. The operators and hardware are professional-grade Pentair and Vevor equipment, specified to commercial standard for strength and security. The price includes delivery and professional installation by Wonderlands World in Central Florida. Book a free design consult at wonderlandsworld.com and let''s design yours.', 'https://www.wonderlandsworld.com/flip', 'flagged', 7),
  ('WW-008', 'Prague Driveway Gate 18''×6''', 'Gate', 'Wonderlands World', '18'' × 6''', NULL, 897000, 'https://www.wonderlandsworld.com/media/prague-driveway-gate.webp', 'Our widest Prague gate, at 18'' × 6'', is an entrance in the estate sense — a long, level sweep of European-styled ironwork that gives a grand driveway its proper threshold. Its motors, hinges, and hardware are professional-grade Pentair and Vevor components throughout, engineered for spans of this scale. The price includes delivery and professional installation by Wonderlands World in Central Florida. Book a free design consult at wonderlandsworld.com and let''s design yours.', 'https://www.wonderlandsworld.com/flip', 'flagged', 8),
  ('WW-009', 'Barrel Sauna 4-Person', 'Sauna', 'Wonderlands World', '8''L × 6''Dia', NULL, 1800000, 'https://www.wonderlandsworld.com/media/barrel-sauna.webp', 'A ritual, given form. The 4-person barrel sauna — 8 feet long, 6 feet in diameter — uses its curved profile to circulate heat evenly and quickly, settling into the garden as a sculptural object as much as a retreat. Its heater and fittings are professional-grade Pentair and Vevor components, built to a commercial standard. The price includes delivery and professional installation by Wonderlands World in Central Florida. Book a free design consult at wonderlandsworld.com and let''s design yours.', 'https://www.wonderlandsworld.com/flip', 'live', 9),
  ('WW-010', 'Barrel Sauna 6-Person', 'Sauna', 'Wonderlands World', '10''L × 7''Dia', NULL, 2160000, 'https://www.wonderlandsworld.com/media/barrel-sauna.webp', 'Room for the whole household, held in a single graceful curve. The 6-person barrel sauna measures 10 feet by 7 feet, its rounded shell moving warm air in a continuous, even flow while presenting a quiet silhouette outdoors. The heating equipment and hardware are professional-grade Pentair and Vevor components, specified without compromise. The price includes delivery and professional installation by Wonderlands World in Central Florida. Book a free design consult at wonderlandsworld.com and let''s design yours.', 'https://www.wonderlandsworld.com/flip', 'flagged', 10),
