  ('WW-012', 'Infrared Sauna 2-Person', 'Sauna', 'Wonderlands World', '5'' × 4'' × 6.5''H', NULL, 3000000, 'https://www.wonderlandsworld.com/media/barrel-sauna.webp', 'Infrared heat works at a lower temperature and a deeper level. This compact 2-person sauna — 5'' × 4'' × 6.5''H — is designed for recovery, circulation, and unhurried quiet, its panels delivering gentle, penetrating warmth session after session. The panels and controls are professional-grade Pentair and Vevor equipment throughout. The price includes delivery and professional installation by Wonderlands World in Central Florida. Book a free design consult at wonderlandsworld.com and let''s design yours.', 'https://www.wonderlandsworld.com/flip', 'flagged', 12),
  ('WW-013', 'Shasta', 'Spa', 'Latham', '7'' diameter', '3''', 1321300, 'https://www.wonderlandsworld.com/media/1a143a47-5e78-46a8-8172-426b7644bea8.webp', 'A circle is the oldest social geometry. The Shasta, a 7'' round Latham spa at 3'' deep, gathers everyone at an equal distance from the center — made for long Florida evenings beside the pool it completes. Its circulation package is professional equipment — Pentair and Vevor pumps, filtration, and controls, specified to a commercial standard. The price includes delivery and professional installation by Wonderlands World in Central Florida. Book a free design consult at wonderlandsworld.com and let''s design yours.', 'https://www.wonderlandsworld.com/flip', 'live', 13),
